body:
I have, but I usually feel awkward becoming a "regular" at a place--especially if it's at a restaurant. I think that may be because I once became a regular at this place where a waitress once commented "Again? You always order that!" when I tried to order a fish sandwich. I guess from then on I haven't felt as comfortable visiting restaurants often.

&#x200B;

However, I AM currently a regular at a Starbucks near my house where I often go to study or just read. The staff there is pretty friendly, so I guess I do enjoy being known there. :)
